SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_BaldingMan::
	.string "KURT: Hey there, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "The guards up top took off when I\n"
	.string "shouted at them.\p"
	.string "But then I took a tumble down the\n"
	.string "WELL.\p"
	.string "I slammed down hard on my back,\n"
	.string "so I can’t move.\p"
	.string "Rats! If I were fit, my POKéMON\n"
	.string "would’ve punished them...\p"
	.string "Ah, it can’t be helped.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, show them how gutsy you are\n"
	.string "in my place!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt4Intro::
	.string "Darn! I was standing guard up top\n"
	.string "when some old coot yelled at me.\p"
	.string "He startled me so much that I fell\n"
	.string "down here.\p"
	.string "I think I’ll vent my anger by taking\n"
	.string "it out on you!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt4Defeat::
	.string "Arrgh! This is NOT my day!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt4::
	.string "Sure, we’ve been hacking the tails\n"
	.string "off SLOWPOKE and selling them.\p"
	.string "Everything we do is for profit.\p"
	.string "That’s right! We’re TEAM ROCKET,\n"
	.string "and we’ll do anything for money!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt6Intro::
	.string "Stop taking TAILS?\p"
	.string "Yeah, just try to defeat all of us!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt6Defeat::
	.string "You rotten brat!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt6::
	.string "SLOWPOKETAILS grow back fast!\n"
	.string "What’s wrong with selling them?$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_Slowpoke_1::
	.string "A SLOWPOKE with its TAIL cut off...\p"
	.string "Huh? It has MAIL. Read it?$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_Slowpoke_2::
	.string "That’s too personal...$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_Slowpoke_3::
	.string "{PLAYER} read the MAIL.\p"
	.string "Be good and look after the house\n"
	.string "with Grandpa and SLOWPOKE.\l"
	.string "Love, Dad$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt5Intro::
	.string "Quit taking SLOWPOKETAILS?\p"
	.string "If we obeyed you, TEAM ROCKET’s rep\n"
	.string "would be ruined!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt5Defeat::
	.string "Just...\n"
	.string "Too strong...$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt5::
	.string "We need the money, but selling\n"
	.string "SLOWPOKETAILS?\p"
	.string "It’s tough being a ROCKET GRUNT!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_Slowpoke2::
	.string "A SLOWPOKE with its TAIL cut off...$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_RocketM_1::
	.string "What do you want?\p"
	.string "If you interrupt our work, don’t\n"
	.string "expect any mercy!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_RocketMDefeat::
	.string "You did OK today, brat, but wait\n"
	.string "’til next time!$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_3::
	.string "LAKE OF RAGE is back to normal.\n"
	.string "T"
SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_RocketMVictory::
	.string "he MAGIKARP have returned.\p"
	.string "I may yet realize my dream of\n"
	.string "seeing the world’s largest\l"
	.string "MAGIKARP.\p"
	.string "Do you have a ROD?\n"
	.string "Please help me if you do.$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_RocketM_2::
	.string "Yeah, TEAM ROCKET was broken up\n"
	.string "three years ago.\p"
	.string "But we continued our activities\n"
	.string "underground.\p"
	.string "Now you can have fun watching us\n"
	.string "stir up trouble!$"

SlowpokeWell_Cave1_Text_Trigger1::
	.string "KURT: Way to go, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET has taken off.\p"
	.string "My back’s better too. Let’s get out\n"
	.string "of here.$"
